{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17215140","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17215140","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1721514001:0":{"text":"헉... 헉... 더는 안 되겠습니다, 분대장님. 팔이 부러질 것 같아요!","source_cn":"呼……呼……不行了，队长！我的胳膊要断了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9584474F17BFEA9D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1721514002:0":{"text":"힘이 왜 이렇게 세십니까? 전 분대장님의 활은 당기지도 못하겠는데...","source_cn":"您的力气太大了！您用的弓我完全拉不开……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA7076096692E4BC2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1721514003:0":{"text":"그 무거운 걸로 멀리서 연속으로 과녁 한가운데를 맞히시다니... 정말 경이롭습니다!","source_cn":"而您竟然能拉着它在百步外连续命中靶心……太不可思议了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA83BEBD86457530F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1721514004:1":{"text":"마틴, 궁수와 검사는 달라. 검사는 폭발력에 의존하지만, 우리는 인내와 절대적인 안정성에 의존하지.","source_cn":"弓箭手和剑士不同，马丁。剑士依赖爆发力，而我们依赖的是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD72B3524AAF7BAFC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1721514005:0":{"text":"심장 박동이 조준에 영향을 미치는 순간, 네 화살은 이미 목표에서 벗어난 거야.","source_cn":"当心跳干扰到瞄准的那一刻，你手中的箭就已经偏离了目标。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBCFFC543AFABAE51","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1721514006:0":{"text":"알겠습니다! 제가 분대장님 실력의 반의반만 따라가도 저 수다쟁이 녀석들이 얕보지 못할 텐데...","source_cn":"属下受教了！只要能练出队长您三成的本事，看那帮碎嘴的家...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC60D360CE3E95FFB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1721514007:0":{"text":"그럼 전 화살을 회수하러 다녀오겠습니다. 먼저 쉬십시오!","source_cn":"那我先去回收箭矢了！队长您也早点休息！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x59130F86457CE6D0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1721514008:1":{"text":"그래. 훈련이 끝나면 무기 관리도 잊지 말고.","source_cn":"去吧，训练完记得保养武器。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEF9577AFB7E5FB93","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:守备军马丁":{"text":"근위대원 마틴","source":"守备军马丁","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:格温妮丝":{"text":"귀네스","source":"格温妮丝","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":9,"localized_text_count":8,"speaker_count":2}}